  ],
  "duration_s": 85.308005,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "今天让你破费了，领导饭钱是小事儿，能跟您单独请教一次。这顿对我来说是投资，真会说话，我这肚子喝茶都能胖。领导，您那不叫胖，那叫宰相肚里能撑船，装的全是大事儿，这藕是好藕啊，就是心眼儿太多了。领导，您虽然心儿多，但也是您的下酒菜啊，年轻就是好啊，年轻就是还够够撑啊，沉稳，还要向您多学习。我们才能变得更优秀，咋这么多饭你喂猪呢？领导，我哪敢啊，我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，都说在箱肚里能撑船，更何况只是一碗饭呢。小王，你这菜点的也太多了，领导菜点的再多，也比不上平时您对我的照顾。多这杯酒，我先敬您。鱼是好鱼，可惜就是刺。多领导，您看虽然刺多，但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。哎，你什么意思啊？怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。领导美满美满，代表幸福美满，这辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。小王啊，你个子是真高比，我高一头呢个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？哈哈，关注我，每天学点高情商，说话技巧，让你的路越走越宽。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1050,
      "text": "今天让你破费了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1470,
      "end_ms": 3270,
      "text": "领导饭钱是小事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3370,
      "end_ms": 4750,
      "text": "能跟您单独请教一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4810,
      "end_ms": 6250,
      "text": "这顿对我来说是投资，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00005",
      "start_ms": 8010,
      "end_ms": 8830,
      "text": "真会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9070,
      "end_ms": 10690,
      "text": "我这肚子喝茶都能胖。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11470,
      "end_ms": 11890,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12070,
      "end_ms": 12910,
      "text": "您那不叫胖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00009",
      "start_ms": 13190,
      "end_ms": 14710,
      "text": "那叫宰相肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14810,
      "end_ms": 15930,
      "text": "装的全是大事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17870,
      "end_ms": 19130,
      "text": "这藕是好藕啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19250,
      "end_ms": 20610,
      "text": "就是心眼儿太多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00013",
      "start_ms": 20810,
      "end_ms": 21210,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21610,
      "end_ms": 22670,
      "text": "您虽然心儿多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22770,
      "end_ms": 24050,
      "text": "但也是您的下酒菜啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00016",
      "start_ms": 26510,
      "end_ms": 27810,
      "text": "年轻就是好啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28670,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "年轻就是还够够撑啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00018",
      "start_ms": 30060,
      "end_ms": 30480,
      "text": "沉稳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00019",
      "start_ms": 30660,
      "end_ms": 31720,
      "text": "还要向您多学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00020",
      "start_ms": 31920,
      "end_ms": 33100,
      "text": "我们才能变得更优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00021",
      "start_ms": 33840,
      "end_ms": 35500,
      "text": "咋这么多饭你喂猪呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00022",
      "start_ms": 35640,
      "end_ms": 35980,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00023",
      "start_ms": 35980,
      "end_ms": 36700,
      "text": "我哪敢啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00024",
      "start_ms": 36800,
      "end_ms": 38840,
      "text": "我还以为您的饭量和肚量是一样的呢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00025",
      "start_ms": 38980,
      "end_ms": 40460,
      "text": "都说在箱肚里能撑船，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00026",
      "start_ms": 40720,
      "end_ms": 41900,
      "text": "更何况只是一碗饭呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00027",
      "start_ms": 43560,
      "end_ms": 44000,
      "text": "小王，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00028",
      "start_ms": 44380,
      "end_ms": 45960,
      "text": "你这菜点的也太多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00029",
      "start_ms": 46580,
      "end_ms": 47820,
      "text": "领导菜点的再多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00030",
      "start_ms": 47880,
      "end_ms": 49380,
      "text": "也比不上平时您对我的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00031",
      "start_ms": 49380,
      "end_ms": 50240,
      "text": "多这杯酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00032",
      "start_ms": 50240,
      "end_ms": 50880,
      "text": "我先敬您。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00033",
      "start_ms": 52140,
      "end_ms": 52960,
      "text": "鱼是好鱼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00034",
      "start_ms": 53260,
      "end_ms": 54100,
      "text": "可惜就是刺。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00035",
      "start_ms": 54100,
      "end_ms": 54760,
      "text": "多领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00036",
      "start_ms": 54760,
      "end_ms": 55900,
      "text": "您看虽然刺多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00037",
      "start_ms": 55920,
      "end_ms": 58420,
      "text": "但主心骨只有一根心腹是没有刺的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00038",
      "start_ms": 59980,
      "end_ms": 60235,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00039",
      "start_ms": 60620,
      "end_ms": 61415,
      "text": "你什么意思啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00040",
      "start_ms": 61730,
      "end_ms": 62935,
      "text": "怎么到我这儿就剩半杯了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00041",
      "start_ms": 63730,
      "end_ms": 64950,
      "text": "领导美满美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00042",
      "start_ms": 64950,
      "end_ms": 65875,
      "text": "代表幸福美满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00043",
      "start_ms": 66130,
      "end_ms": 68065,
      "text": "这辈子美满就是一辈子美满啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00044",
      "start_ms": 69410,
      "end_ms": 70030,
      "text": "小王啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00045",
      "start_ms": 70270,
      "end_ms": 71550,
      "text": "你个子是真高比，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00046",
      "start_ms": 71550,
      "end_ms": 76705,
      "text": "我高一头呢个高是为了给领导探路走哪儿不还是得听领导指挥吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00047",
      "start_ms": 77350,
      "end_ms": 77730,
      "text": "哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00048",
      "start_ms": 79380,
      "end_ms": 79980,
      "text": "关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00049",
      "start_ms": 80100,
      "end_ms": 81440,
      "text": "每天学点高情商，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00050",
      "start_ms": 81520,
      "end_ms": 82375,
      "text": "说话技巧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_53189cd46f764216_s00051",
      "start_ms": 83020,
      "end_ms": 85075,
      "text": "让你的路越走越宽。"
    }
  ],
